      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T10:17:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The original HIDL vts expected success even when the upstream interface is not valid in this API, but it will be validated in other configuration APIs. This was also requested by Qualcomm in their comments as this is the old behavior.\nI removed the EX_ILLEGAL_ARGUMENT error from the getForwardedStats API comment.",
