        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T06:42:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is weird to allow throwing different exception for the same parameter. The API says it will throw EX_ILLEGAL_ARGUMENT if any parameters are invalid (such as invalid upstream or negative number of bytes)\n\nWhy not just EX_ILLEGAL_ARGUMENT ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 426,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 426,
        "endChar": 75
