      "writtenOn": "2023-01-04T10:17:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The future Android versions that only has AIDL interface supported may run on the old devices which don\u0027t support warning limit, they have to return EX_UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION in this case.\nI added another test case to verify this: SetDataWarningAndLimitUnlimitedWarningOk",
